#: src/ui/sstv_tab.py:384
msgid ""
"AX.25 baud rate for SSDV (AX.25) reception.\n"
"Selecting a satellite or transponder sets this from the baud\n"
"rate in its name (e.g. 1k2 / 4k8 / 9k6); 1200 if it names none.\n"
"You can still change it by hand. Shared with the APRS tab.\n"
"Not used by the other modes."
msgstr ""

#: src/ui/sstv_tab.py:404
msgid ""
"Receives images from amateur satellites. Pick the mode below, then the "
"satellite in Radio Control (or the input box at the right).\n"
"\n"
"SSTV (analog picture over FM; Robot36 and PD120 only):\n"
"  • ISS (NORAD 25544) 145.800 MHz FM — PD120 (Mode V)\n"
"  • ISS 437.550 MHz FM — Robot36 (Mode U); events are announced at https://"
"ariss.psnc.pl\n"
"  • UmKA-1, JAMX01, AHMAT-1, GALAPAGOS-UTE-SWSU, TeikyoSat-4, SEEDS II, "
"WREN, UTMN2, Monitor-3, QMR-KWT 2 … (Mode U, occasional)\n"
"  Martin / Scottie / Robot72 are not supported (e.g. SONATE-2 Martin M1, "
"VIZARD-meteo Robot72).\n"
"\n"
"SSDV (AX.25): 1200 / 4800 / 9600 baud AX.25 packets through Direwolf (Rig + "
"sound card, or SDR). Listed with SSDV: LAPAN-A2 (1200 baud AFSK). Not yet "
"verified with a real reception.\n"
"\n"
"SSDV (CCSDS BPSK 9k6): ASRTU-1 / AO-123 (NORAD 61781) 436.210 MHz, decoded "
"by gr-satellites. Needs an SDR.\n"
"\n"
"SSDV (2FSK 800bps): HADES-SA / SO-127 (NORAD 68446) 436.875 MHz, raw 800 "
"baud 2FSK (AMSAT-EA format). Needs an SDR.\n"
"\n"
"Selecting HADES-SA or ASRTU-1 switches the mode automatically."
msgstr ""

#: src/ui/sstv_tab.py:429
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"SSDV (GEOSCAN 9k6): Lobachevsky (NORAD 67284) 436.320 MHz, 9k6 GFSK in "
"Geoscan's own framing (not AX.25), decoded by gr-satellites like the "
"Telemetry tab. Needs an SDR. No SSDV frame has been received yet. Selecting "
"Lobachevsky switches the mode automatically."
msgstr ""

#: src/ui/sstv_tab.py:435
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"SSDV (ERMINAZ-2 9k6): ERMINAZ-2U (435.900 MHz) / 2V (145.920 MHz) / 2X "
"(145.960 MHz). CCSDS TM frames carrying SSDV space packets (APID 500), "
"demodulated by this app. Needs an SDR. The satellite sends SSDV only while "
"AMSAT-DL has switched it on. Not yet verified with a real reception. "
"Selecting one of them switches the mode automatically."
msgstr ""

